ng application start time: 0x1DBC28ADCFE6FE3\nFaulting application path: I:\\Godot_v4.4.1-stable_mono_win64\\Godot_v4.4.1-stable_mono_win64.exe\nFaulting module path: C:\\WINDOWS\\System32\\DriverStore\\FileRepository\\nv_dispi.inf_amd64_fcb8b2221bca6b43\\nvoglv64.dll\nReport Id: a46c00f3-5ae8-432a-a1f2-0562c3812d94\nFaulting package full name: \nFaulting package-relative application ID: \n\nThen this Informational:\n\nFault bucket 1892843216624930987, type 4\nEvent Name: APPCRASH\nResponse: Not available\nCab Id: 0\n\nProblem signature:\nP1: Godot_v4.4.1-stable_mono_win64.exe\nP2: 4.4.1.0\nP3: 67e3400c\nP4: nvoglv64.dll\nP5: 32.0.15.7628\nP6: 680e5f6a\nP7: c0000005\nP8: 0000000000e6ccf1\nP9: \nP10: \n\n\n\n\n\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2870033031/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885260039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106228#issuecomment-2885260039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106228","id":2885260039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r-ZMH","user":{"login":"moskvax","id":577766,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU3Nzc2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/577766?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax","html_url":"https://github.com/moskvax","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/moskvax/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T23:22:19Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T23:29:14Z","body":"I also get this driver crash since 4.4. Same cause (quitting the launched game by closing the window, having about a 50% chance to trigger the crash), same total system freeze, monitors switching off and driver out of memory message in the event viewer. \n\nSystem info: Godot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2080 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7615) - AMD Ryzen 9 5900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads)\n\nA workaround I've found is to use the D3D12 backend (project settings -> rendering device -> Driver.windows = d3d12). It's slower to compile but does not lead to these crashes.\n\nSeems like [#105406](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105406#issue-2995684788) may also be the same issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885260039/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885298448","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106228#issuecomment-2885298448","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106228","id":2885298448,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6r-ikQ","user":{"login":"Bound2bCoding","id":16976618,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTc2NjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16976618?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding","html_url":"https://github.com/Bound2bCoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-15T23:54:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-15T23:54:15Z","body":"I am going to take moskvax's advice and switch my windows driver to d3d12.  I want to confirm this prevents the crash. Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2885298448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888431451","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106228#issuecomment-2888431451","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106228","id":2888431451,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sKfdb","user":{"login":"Bound2bCoding","id":16976618,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2OTc2NjE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16976618?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding","html_url":"https://github.com/Bound2bCoding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bound2bCoding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/use